    "created_at": "2026-05-14T22:23:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-14T22:23:39Z",
    "body": "I checked the current source and the HTMLOptionsCollection.length algorithm already appears to describe the behavior in DOM tree-mutation terms (e.g. truncating/removing option elements from parent nodes).\n\nI also searched for MutationObserver-related references in the current source.\n\nIs there still a specific wording or test change needed for this issue?",
