    "created_at": "2026-05-15T13:23:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-15T13:23:37Z",
    "body": "I think \"Append n new [option](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-option-element) elements with no attributes and no child nodes to the [select](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-select-element) element on which [this](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this) is rooted.\" is still inaccurate as it doesn't describe the `DocumentFragment` wrapping. Some of the algorithms also invoke public API and there's some duplication.\n\nThis might be somewhat involved for someone completely new to fix though so let me remove \"good first issue\".",
